{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "API Documentation Reminder",
  "description": "Reminds to update API documentation (/api-docs, /docs, /ai-agent-guide.html) when API routes or related files are modified",
  "version": "1",
  "when": {
    "type": "fileEdited",
    "patterns": [
      "api/routes.py",
      "api/*.py",
      "services/*.py",
      "models/models.py"
    ]
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "API接口文件已修改。请检查并更新以下文档以保持同步：\n1. API文档: static/api-docs.html 或 API_ENDPOINTS.md\n2. Swagger文档: /docs 端点\n3. AI智能体使用指南: static/ai-agent-guide.html\n\n确保文档反映最新的API变化，包括新增、修改或删除的端点、参数变化、响应格式更新等。"
  }
}